    <string name="kbfr_about_title">About this fork</string>
    <string name="kbfr_about_fork_title">Modified version of FUTO Keyboard</string>
    <string name="kbfr_about_fork_body">This is Clavier Atabold, a modified version of FUTO Keyboard. The keyboard, the speech models and the payment screens are the work and property of FUTO Holdings, Inc., used under the FUTO Source First License 1.1-kb: thank you, FUTO. The modifications (online correction, privacy rules, this name and icon) were made by Atabold: github.com/Atabold. This version is not affiliated with or endorsed by FUTO, and FUTO does not support it. Payments made on FUTO payment screens go to FUTO, not to the author of this version. Source and licences: github.com/Atabold/atabold-keyboard-android</string>
    <string name="kbfr_payment_notice_title">Who gets this payment</string>
    <string name="kbfr_payment_notice_body">You are using Clavier Atabold, a modified version of FUTO Keyboard made by Atabold (github.com/Atabold). FUTO Keyboard and this payment screen belong to FUTO Holdings, Inc. Everything you pay here goes to FUTO. The author of this modified version receives nothing.</string>
    <string name="kbfr_crash_reports_title">Offer to email crash reports to FUTO</string>
    <string name="kbfr_crash_reports_subtitle">Off by default. After a crash, the keyboard can ask whether to email FUTO a report: stack trace, device data and settings values, never your text. FUTO does not support this modified version: report problems at github.com/Atabold instead.</string>
    <!-- Above FUTO's "Updates Notice" on the settings home: that notice and its link are about FUTO Keyboard. -->
    <string name="kbfr_updates_note">New versions of Clavier Atabold are published only on GitHub: github.com/Atabold/atabold-keyboard. The notice below is FUTO\'s and is about FUTO Keyboard, a different app.</string>
